,"html":"<p>Built an application for data preparation/processing of geographic remote sensing data, visualization, real-time training performance evaluation, post-processing and output generation as a semi-automation approach along with a self-designed CNN architecture to handle multimodal and/or <a href=\"http://www2.isprs.org/commissions/comm3/wg4/2d-sem-label-potsdam.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">multispectral imagery</a> along with adaptability to varying application requirements</p>"}}]},"projects":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Child Mortality Analysis","tech":["Python","Dask","Hadoop","MapReduce","Spark","GCP"],"github":"https://github.com/the-karanshah/Child-Mortality-Analysis.git","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Analysis on secondary factors contributing to child mortality using Big Data Techniques, under supervision of <a href=\"https://www3.cs.stonybrook.edu/~has/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prof. Andrew Schwartz</a>. </li>\n<li>Implemented Linear Regression and Similarity Search running on women lifestyle real data distributed on Hadoop clusters</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Communication System","tech":["Java","Javascript","SQLite","Servlets"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>A web-based software for employees of a Software Company to send/receive messages, share files in person, groups and broadcast channels with various administrative permission roles</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Image Denoising","tech":["Python","Keras","Numpy"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Trained &#x26; executed a Deep Neural Network on Overhead Images having Gaussian Noise, achieving 90% accuracy with computational efficiency and ability to generalize well despite limited training data of Worldview Imagery samples provided by DigitalGlobe</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Retail Sales Data Analysis","tech":["Python","Pandas","Dask"],"github":"","external":"https://github.com/the-karanshah/Retail-Sales-Data-Analysis/blob/master/Final%20Report.pdf"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Analysis on a market basket dataset to provide insights to help the company with business by finding reasons for drop in sales, under Supervision of <a href=\"https://www3.cs.stonybrook.edu/~skiena/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prof. Steven Skiena</a>. </li>\n<li>Implemented Word2Vec and LSTM model with k-means clustering to improve Shelf Space Management and Inventory management.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Local Storage Sync.","tech":["AWS","Node.js","Electron.js"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Built cross-platform application to fully synchronize local storage and AWS S3 storage</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Web Search Engine","tech":["Java","Python","Ajax","PHP","Crawler4j"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>A search engine implemented using Apache Solr PageRank, and Lucene algorithms. </li>\n<li>It crawls web and gathers data and indexes the webpages using Apache Tika parser with advanced features like spell checking, autocompletion and generation of snippets for improving result display</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Covid Data Analysis","tech":["Python","Pandas","Scipy"],"github":"https://github.com/the-karanshah/Covid-Impact-Analysis.git","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Analysed Covid's impact using a Covid dataset and an associated (non-covid) dataset, instructed by <a href=\"https://www3.cs.stonybrook.edu/~anshul/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prof. Anshul Gandhi</a>.</li>\n<li>Performed AR, EWMA, Wald's test, Z-test, t-test, K-S test, permutation test, correlation, and Bayesian inference along with suitable visualizations</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Nerve Segmentation","tech":["Python","Keras","Tensorflow","VGG16"],"github":"","external":"https://www.kaggle.com/c/ultrasound-nerve-segmentation"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Implemented and trained a CNN architecture based on U-net for segmentation using pretrained weights of VGG16 to participate in a <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/c/ultrasound-nerve-segmentation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Kaggle Competition</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Movie Recommendation","tech":["Python","SVM","Neural Network"],"github":"","external":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>A system to suggest movies based on a user's interests using MovieLens dataset</li>\n<li>Implemented SVM and Fully Connected Neural Network</li>\n</ul>"}}]},"contact":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Get In Touch"},"html":"<p>Lets discuss problems and find optimum solutions. Feel free to reach out.</p>"}}]}},"pageContext":{"isCreatedByStatefulCreatePages":true}}}